@startuml
title Qualification Lane
left to right direction
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #1d4f73
skinparam Rectangle {
  BorderColor #1d4f73
  BackgroundColor #eef6fb
  FontColor #0f172a
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam Note {
  BorderColor #8b6f2f
  BackgroundColor #fff7d6
  FontColor #3f3420
}

rectangle "Manual web or API trigger\nSOK_PIPELINE_MODE=qualification_lane" as trigger
rectangle "Baseline\nverify and test jobs" as baseline
rectangle "Released SOK contract\nresolve released image and chart inputs" as contract
rectangle "Released image scan\nscan-released-operator-image-container" as scan
rectangle "Qualification EKS runtime\nfull validation in one cluster" as runtime_eks #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification FIPS runtime\nexisting-cluster smoke + managersecret" as runtime_fips #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification Azure runtime\nazure_sanity" as runtime_azure #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification GCP runtime\nGCP sanity fanout" as runtime_gcp #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification distroless runtime\ndistroless EKS fanout" as runtime_distroless #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification Graviton runtime\narm64 fanout" as runtime_graviton #eefbf1
rectangle "Qualification Helm runtime\nfull chart validation" as runtime_helm #eefbf1
rectangle "Decision outputs\nmanifest, report, gate,\ncompatibility publish plan" as report #f7f7ff

trigger --> baseline
baseline --> contract
contract --> scan
scan --> runtime_eks
scan --> runtime_fips
scan --> runtime_azure
scan --> runtime_gcp
scan --> runtime_distroless
scan --> runtime_graviton
scan --> runtime_helm
runtime_eks --> report
runtime_fips --> report
runtime_azure --> report
runtime_gcp --> report
runtime_distroless --> report
runtime_graviton --> report
runtime_helm --> report

note bottom of contract
Qualification tests the current released SOK baseline.
It is a compatibility lane, not a develop-branch build lane.
end note

note bottom of runtime_graviton
The Graviton suite set stays aligned with the existing
splunk-operator-cicd arm64 validation matrix.
end note
@enduml
